From: Evolve Expansion <expansion@example.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:06:58 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Silverblood v1.2 part 1b: warrior duels, wild Awakened fixes

Duels
- When an Awakened One attacks the garrison, each active warrior may
  notice (Sense / 2 %) and step in; faster ones arrive first, max 2
- Win chance = sum(P^2) / (sum(P^2) + S^2), clamped 5-95%, where
  P = might x era x (1 + Speed/200), x2 Full Power, +10%/+25% when
  strained / on the brink
- Outcomes: win (bounty, record), repelled (monster -20%, quiet 2 min,
  warrior recovers 3 days), lost (soldier dies, 30% death check)
- +8 meter at the start: a warrior on the brink may Awaken mid-fight;
  her sister may strike a mercy blow (20% + Will / 4)
- Stance per warrior: Intercept / Hold back (Hot-headed and Volatile
  may disobey)

Fixes
- Wild Awakened need 10+ garrison soldiers to appear
- Wild strength: era roll, capped at 60-110% of army rating
- Awakened Ones never kill the last 3 soldiers

Wiki Duels section, changelog, README and TESTING updated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
